Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 02:32:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD terminal visual selection copy for focused panes

Keep selection state inside the terminal UI and emit OSC 52 clipboard output from rendered pane content so focused left and right pane text can be copied without expanding the public mode surface.
